ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOZ7XiGF-4QQ7kNvwFwnReW&_nc_oc=AdqzAQTWbalIg4tGgq0mmBYSkI4m6r-iiU_aJBPBXDGw7MLHCRQ0pVVeYEKZBQh1ZUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHDoSUOUlmQ_NvYcBc6X6liRV5L6Ewc4ACeSYBmnh9bA&oe=6B05DA16"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nnAUoOI4GU4Q7kNvwHkL229&_nc_oc=Adpru1oBNPtbR1W32IqkbQQBoMtYm-JB-2lcz-1dUMi27SMFWhFDA9qSQYt_KyxoeUw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdK2WG58MqQL8zd5fW0syBcQxWx8wVdGuuyJvSLTyCPA&oe=6B05A55C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUamdcjZoM4Q7kNvwE8S8ra&_nc_oc=AdpO5UkKrGvsJDMklJ6rPI4eHNxHdzuIkqJ0c30Bx6dBbWDBwuZPuM-_ddNF7eN0l-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUV1SLxR8ZE8TOGDKepyKiDn_DRvkdFOLhcUgqcYxHsA&oe=6B05BEDB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486